  Slug: haunted-citizen
  DisplayName: Haunted Citizen
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: You grew up in a region where undead lurk everywhere. This could be
    a domain as small as a vampire's fief or as vast as the nation of Ustalav. As
    an ever-present concern, the undead greatly shaped your life. Living with fear
    became an everyday skill... as did pleading for your life. Choose two attribute
    boosts. One must be to Wisdom or Charisma , and one is a free attribute boost.
    You're trained in the Diplomacy skill and the Lore skill for your home settlement.
    You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.No Cause for Alarm] skill feat.
